description	"The Secret Apprentice aka 'Starkiller'

Apprentice to the Dark Lord himself, trained to hunt down targets via fearsome Dark Side powers and combo attacks.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (2)
-- Drains/Focuses on hit
-- 25% more special damage
-- 25% more knockback
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 66% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (1)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (1)
- Lightning (1) ^3[CS4]
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]
-- 100% less damage
- Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]

^8Attributes:
- 25% slower skill cooldown
- Force Focus (3)

^3Abilities:
- Dash/Dash Jump (1) ^3[CS2]"